  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "大陸與東協經貿法",
    "sub_ename": "CHINA AND ASEAN ECONOMIC AND TRADE LAW",
    "describe_ch": "大陸市場與東協經濟體是我國經貿發展重要據點，掌握中國與東協各國之相關經貿法規與制度是我國經貿發展的重大議題。本課程藉由大陸經貿法律制度瞭解，及對東協的經貿制度的認識，可提供未來參與國際經營的基本知識。",
    "describe_eh": "In Taiwan, it is an important issue for business operations to understand China and ASEAN countries' foreign trade- and economic-related legal system. This course focuses on understanding the trade-and economic-related legal system among mainland China and ASEAN countries. Thus, students aimed to involve international businesses in China and ASEAN countries can learn from this fundamental knowledge and have an ability to analyze trade- or economic-related legal problems.",
